{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cmaj7]Oh, what a time. [Em]Humanity [Dsus4]broken.
Long had the [C]world in [G/B]darkness [D]lain.
[Bm]Gone were the days [Em]of prophecy spoken.
Gone was the [C]age of [G/B]David's [D]reign.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cmaj7]Oh, what a sign! [Em]The virgin girl [Dsus4]Mary,
Caused to con[C]ceive by [G/B]God a[D]lone.
[Bm]Long-promised hope: [Em]the baby she'd [Dsus4]carry
One day would [C]claim King [G/B]David's [D]throne.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Worship the [G/B]King. [C]Come let us [Em]now a[D]dore Him.
[C]Jesus is [G]here and we can be [D]free.
[G]Bring ev'ry[G/B]thing. [C]Lay it all [Em]down be[D]fore Him.
[C]Sorrow turns [G]joy for all who re[D]ceive Jesus the [G]King.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Cmaj7]Oh, what a night [Em]in the city of [Dsus4]David.
There where the [C]holy [G/B]child was [D]born.
[Bm]One Son of God. [Em]One true Messi[Dsus4]ah.
One King to [C]reign for[G/B]ever[D]more!
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[G]Wonderful Counselor, [Cmaj7]Everlasting Father,
[G]Prince of Peace, Mighty God, [Cmaj7]Holy One, Redeemer,
[Em7]Emmanuel, God With Us, [Cmaj7]Living Word, Christ Jesus,
[Am]King of [G/B]Kings and Lord of [Dsus4]Lords!
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[G]Worship the [G/B]King. [C]Come let us [Em]now a[D]dore Him.
[C]Jesus is [G]here and we can be [D]free.
[G]Bring ev'ry[G/B]thing. [C]Lay it all [Em]down be[D]fore Him.
[C]Sorrow turns [G]joy for all who re[D]ceive Jesus the [G]King.
[Am7]Jesus is [G]King!
{end_of_chorus}
